xt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$1942FEF7-F0A9-4D02-84C2-2960044F8488", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "9f56ba97ba18339c299c862e70a1bbb56958d0ee", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1356, "id": "Q1356"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$AA1987FB-0D6A-4502-A7D3-17D2395C71C7", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "494151350b0ec9d75e29d684e0984169e2c73ea7", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1362, "id": "Q1362"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$BB1B0F19-1258-4EAA-AFB5-AD6836A859AE", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "c46e6c65a52ab9776cd9a704ebee1e20bc77e7d2", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1409, "id": "Q1409"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$B5FF35AF-B37E-47E5-BE83-83D2347C2896", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "b7eaa6e89507dc6b54c3c4ba19db93a147ce8a6f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1386, "id": "Q1386"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$76CF2462-DD28-4F49-8095-B0873F20DDC4", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "c7e1e1023400f659b211fe58b5adf4a1a7e6634e", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1386, "id": "Q1386"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$75640B8D-FD53-41F1-9901-F74CBA54FBA1", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "637fb4ca26c0e29ae240a01e2e271d0cf5c6489a", "datavalue": {"value": "Yeah. And she said to me, \"Would you like to go to Africa, take a trip to Africa?\" I said, \"Oh, Miriam.\" She said, \"I pay your ticket, you know,\" and she did. She took me to Africa first class. She introduced me to the president of Guinea the first morning and he gave me my name Aminata, and she introduced me to a lifestyle. It was all about protocol. I had never hung with government people bef...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12001$46AB0FE9-38CB-4CF4-894D-1342FC868391", "rank": "normal"}]}}